---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const lastUpdated = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---

<Layout
    title="Cookie Policy | BatteryTrail"
    description="How BatteryTrail uses cookies and similar technologies, including advertising and analytics cookies, and how to manage them."
>
    <Header />

    <main class="flex-grow w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
        <div class="mb-10 border-b border-[#224249] pb-8">
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]">
                Cookie Policy
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-text-muted">
                Last updated: {lastUpdated}
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-a:text-primary prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">
            <p>
                This Cookie Policy explains what cookies and similar technologies
                are, which ones we use on the BatteryTrail website (the "Site"),
                and how you can manage them. For more information about how we
                handle your data generally, see our
                <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
            </p>

            <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
            <p>
                Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a
                website. They help the website remember your preferences and
                understand how the site is used. We may also use similar
                technologies such as pixels, local storage, and web beacons.
            </p>

            <h2>Cookies We Use</h2>
            <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
            <p>
                These are necessary for the Site to function, such as remembering
                basic preferences. They do not require consent.
            </p>
            <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
            <p>
                We use analytics cookies to understand how visitors use the Site —
                for example, which pages are visited and how visitors arrive. This
                information is aggregated and helps us improve our content.
            </p>
            <h3>Advertising Cookies (Google AdSense and Partners)</h3>
            <p>
                We may use advertising cookies set by Google AdSense and other
                third-party advertising partners. These cookies are used to serve
                ads that are more relevant to you, to limit how often you see an
                ad, and to measure advertising effectiveness. They may track your
                browsing activity across different websites.
            </p>

            <h2>Third-Party Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                Some cookies on the Site are placed by third-party services we use,
                such as advertising and analytics providers. These third parties
                have their own privacy and cookie policies, and we encourage you to
                review them.
            </p>

            <h2>How to Manage Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                You can control and delete cookies through your browser settings.
                Most browsers allow you to:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>View and delete cookies stored on your device</li>
                <li>Block cookies from specific sites or all sites</li>
                <li>Set preferences for third-party cookies</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                You can also opt out of personalized advertising:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">Digital Advertising Alliance opt-out</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com/" rel="noopener">European Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance (EDAA)</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                Disabling cookies may affect the functionality of the Site and
                other websites you visit.
            </p>

            <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. The "Last
                updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent
                revision.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>
                Questions about this Cookie Policy? Contact us at
                <a href="mailto:chesterbeard@salishseaconsulting.com">chesterbeard@salishseaconsulting.com</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
</Layout>
